WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:10.393
In tutorial 1.8, you'll accept
an invitation from a colleague,

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.354
and land straight in your company.

00:00:13.384 --> 00:00:16.709
First, open the invitation
link your colleague sent you.

00:00:16.759 --> 00:00:19.894
It shows the company, and
the role you're invited as.

00:00:20.938 --> 00:00:24.113
New to Alaventra? Click
Create an account to join.

00:00:24.163 --> 00:00:26.591
The invited e-mail is already filled in.

00:00:27.888 --> 00:00:31.638
Type your name and choose a
password, then click Create account.

00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:33.612
You join the company straight away.

00:00:35.409 --> 00:00:38.659
Already have an account? Click
I already have an account,

00:00:38.709 --> 00:00:40.984
and sign in with the invited e-mail.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.348
Then click Accept and open the dashboard.

00:00:48.413 --> 00:00:52.338
You're in your company's dashboard,
with the role your colleague chose.

00:00:52.388 --> 00:00:54.880
Your name shows at the
bottom of the sidebar.

00:00:55.913 --> 00:01:00.655
So, open the invitation link, create
an account or sign in, and accept.

00:01:01.888 --> 00:01:07.033
You've joined your team. Next, sign in, and
get back in if you forget your password,

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:08.941
in tutorial 1.9.
